Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 14
Author: Harold O. Keedy
Date: 1927-07-30
Byline: Submitted by Harold O. Keedy, Martinsburg, West Virginia. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-07-30_93/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 14
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-08-06_93/page/n32/mode/1up


